{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:36:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_cce33c33b8584de3b079900ae7cabe13","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f8dbe5cbaa7c91bd0cd2be68a4cff33c096d63ef893388dd806654c6d989ac70","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"aws-samples/setup-amazon-bedrock-agent-for-text2sql-using-amazon-redshift-serverless-with-streamlit@892ead9ecba9 snapshot 7f8b0354074963f5","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6e7c5a8d615854fd8a193d2dd8756684d75dd9fd765207a0c6a8ac6ae1136502","slc_adf2e0a2cdc7fae233617b83571a2e0bb7ab80405fce39261a0b6a818484ca5a","slc_ba94803700e5f439be2533b29d4ea519988c85a1d3f43015aed786efa7ef2e96"],"source_ids":["src_96da25b1f1b45b27bc794d935a1a3196"],"text":"Configuration relies on environment variables: the Lambda uses REDSHIFT_WORKGROUP_NAME, while the EC2 instance's /etc/profile.d/bedrock_env.sh defines AGENT_ID, AGENT_ALIAS_ID, and AWS_REGION used by the Streamlit app.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:36:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_cce33c33b8584de3b079900ae7cabe13"}
